  "body": "Automated bridge job `RQ-DRAIN2-PH-08` (pool: devin), single commit on base `e78f74b1f`.\n\n**Tests:** no test command\n\n**Tier-1 (CODEOWNERS) paths, async post-merge review:** src/core/routing/selector.ts test/fleet-self-loop-02soly1.test.ts test/fleet-self-loop-stream-02solc1.test.ts\n\n<details><summary>Agent notes</summary>\n\n# BRIDGE_NOTES — RQ-DRAIN2-PH-08\n\nRework of conflicting PRs **3519, 3517, 3514, 3511, 3510, 3509** in `ashlrai/phantom`\nonto the default branch (`master`). All changes are **uncommitted** in this\nworktree; `publish.sh` owns publishing.\n\n## Per-PR outcomes\n\n- `REWORKS_PR: 3519` — reworked: friction ledger (`~/.ashlr/friction-ledger.jsonl`,\n  JSONL last-write-wins, 256-item/256 KiB caps) feeds `FRICTION TOP` planner-brief\n  sections, `friction_id=` READY lines, pick records, and seven-day pick-grading\n  closure; selector/planner/CLI/docs contract updated, conflict resolved onto\n  master's newer job registry (PR test kept as `test/friction-ledger-03.test.ts`).\n- `REWORKS_PR: 3517` — reworked: deterministic docs sync — `docs-sync.toml`,\n  `phm docs sync [--repo] [--check] [--json]`, `src/core/docs-sync.ts` path/symlink\n  safety, generated `AGENTS.md` command table, `llms.txt`, `llms-full.txt` bundle,\n  `llms-reference.txt`, `docs/DOCS-SYNC.md`, regenerated CLI reference/cli.md.\n- `REWORKS_PR: 3514` — reworked: chief-of-staff draft decline —\n  `phm fleet cos-decline <cos-id> --digest <64-hex>` writes an exclusive `wx`\n  delivery claim (`{state:\"declined\"}`, mode 0600) that blocks any later send;\n  `declined` added to COS status/list/intake delivery unions; bus notices and\n  path-cochange/job-history helpers retained at master's newer versions.\n- `REWORKS_PR: 3511` — reworked: portable TOML agent profiles\n  (`~/.phantom/agents/<id>.toml`) with strict schema, optimistic versioning,\n  archived revisions, `pinAgentProfile`, and fail-closed `send-policy.ts`;\n  `phm agents list|show|validate|versions` routed alongside (not over) the\n  existing Agent Bus `agents bus` command; live email-outbox binding deliberately\n  left unchanged pending separate review.\n- `REWORKS_PR: 3510` — reworked: `cos-work` added as the ninth self-tick stage\n  (after `landed-sweep`, dry-run by default, `--apply` runs one bounded COS pass\n  with injected deps and best-effort bus notice); master's newer `stray-stop` and\n  `meter-incident` stages preserved; all self-tick tests updated to nine steps.\n- `REWORKS_PR: 3509` — reworked: `phm fleet cos-loop` verb plus COS loop core\n  (`src/core/cos/loop.ts`) with tests, integrated with current registry and\n  cos-work changes.\n\nNone of the six intents were already on the base; nothing was superseded.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Base: worktree HEAD `e78f74b` (master tip at session start). `origin/master`\n  advanced ~20 bridge commits to `1048a4e` during the session; the worktree\n  intentionally remains on its base — publish/rebase is owned downstream.\n- PR branches carried large stale bundled histories (thousands of files,\n  including already-merged bridge work); only each task commit's feature diff\n  was ported semantically, preferring master's structure.\n- `gh` CLI was unusable in the sandbox (config unreadable, API rate-limited);\n  PR state/diffs were taken from public GitHub pages and `refs/pull/*/head`\n  fetches. All six PRs were OPEN at inspection time.\n- Follow-on fixes required by repo guards: `agents <verb> --help/-h` now prints\n  usage (exit 0) via a shared `agents` help surface; `checkpoint resume --help`\n  help-token handling widened (pre-existing base bug); `docs/CODEMAP.md` gained\n  the missing `src/core/dailyfix/` inventory line (pre-existing base drift).\n- `phm docs sync --check` reports `drift: []` — all generated artifacts are in\n  sync. It exits nonzero only for pre-existing repo-wide command-coverage gaps\n  (79 top-level commands lack fenced copy-paste examples), which is the\n  tool's designed signal, not a regression.\n\n## Commands run (verification)\n\n- `npm run install:worktree` — repaired a broken ESLint install\n  (`node_modules/eslint/lib/cli.js` missing); `wt-deps` + `tsc-warm` ok.\n- `npx tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.json` — **PASS** (0 errors).\n- `npm run typecheck` (tsc backend) — **PASS** earlier in session.\n- `npx eslint <all changed files>` — **PASS**, 0 problems.\n- `npm run check:docs` — **PASS** (0 errors, 253 local links checked).\n- `node scripts/verify-changed.mjs` — **PASS** (file selection, fleet registry,\n  eslint changed files, tsgo, realio lane lint, verse sync-I/O lint, dedupe).\n- `npx vitest run` affected suites (temp `HOME=$(mktemp -d)` throughout):\n  - Feature tests — friction-ledger-03, docs-sync, cos-decline, cos-bus-notice,\n    cos-cli-roundtrip, agent-profile, send-policy, self-tick-cos-work-14,\n    fleet-cos-loop, fleet-self-loop-02soly1, self-tick-landed-sweep-03,\n    routing-selector, planner-brief, planner-brief-coverage, pick-grader,\n    fleet-path-cochanges-04-spv2, fleet-job-history-await-04-spu2,\n    self-tick-inbox-acks-04, self-tick-order-notices-05,\n    fleet-self-loop-stream-02solc1, fleet-self-tick-last-cli,\n    fleet-self-tick-last-validation-02sole1, fleet-self-tick-log-cap-cli-02,\n    fleet-self-tick-write-recovery-02solz2, fleet-self-tick, cos-worker —\n    all passing.\n  - Registry/drift/doc guards — doc-facts, cli-registry-drift,\n    fleet-registry-help/complete/reachable-04, fleet-subcommand-registry,\n    cli-docs-drift, cli-reference-drift, docs-llms-txt, codemap-drift,\n    generate-site-llms — **695 + 66 tests passing** across the final runs.\n  - `test/cli-help-no-side-effects.test.ts` — **1083/1083 passed** in the final\n    full run; earlier failures (`agents <verb> --help`, `docs sync --help`,\n    `checkpoint resume --help`) were fixed and re-verified.\n  - `test/m25.index.test.ts` — passes standalone (41/41); fails only inside\n    large multi-file batches due to a pre-existing module-mock isolation quirk,\n    unrelated to this change.\n\n## Pass/fail counts\n\n- Typecheck (tsgo + tsc): **PASS**\n- ESLint (changed files): **PASS** (0 problems)\n- `check:docs`: **PASS**\n- `verify-changed.mjs`: **PASS**\n- Affected vitest suites: **all green** in final runs (see commands above);\n  one pre-existing batch-isolation flake in `m25.index.test.ts` noted.\n- `docs sync --check`: drift **0**; command coverage incomplete (pre-existing).\n\n## Net LOC (vs worktree base `e78f74b`, uncommitted)\n\n- Total: **56 files, +67,536 / −116** (net **+67,420**).\n- `docs/llms-full.txt` alone is +65,227 — it is a generated bundle of all\n  public docs pages, produced by the new docs-sync pipeline.\n- Excluding generated doc artifacts (`llms-full.txt`, `llms.txt`,\n  `llms-reference.txt`, `CLI-REFERENCE.md`, `cli.md`, `CODEMAP.md`):\n  **50 files, +2,025 / −63** (net **+1,962**) of hand-written source, tests,\n  and docs.\n\n## Boundaries honored\n\n- No `git commit`, `git push`, `git tag`, `gh pr create/merge/close`, or `gh api`\n  writes were run. No `.github/` edits. No secrets printed. No tests weakened,\n  skipped, or deleted; no security controls loosened.\n</details>\n",
